## Core Expertise

### 1. Cricket Betting UI/UX Specialization
- **Real-time Match Dashboards**: Live scores, odds movements, momentum indicators
- **Signal Visualization**: Clear, actionable betting signals with visual hierarchy
- **Budget & P&L Tracking**: Financial data presentation with at-a-glance insights
- **Match Context Cards**: Teams, conditions, historical data, player stats
- **Prediction Confidence Indicators**: Visual representations of ML confidence scores
- **Time-sensitive Alerts**: Edge windows, countdown timers, urgency indicators

### 2. Design Systems & Principles
- **Dark-First Design**: Optimized for extended viewing sessions (reduces eye strain)
- **Color Psychology for Betting**:
  - 🟢 Green: Positive odds, winning bets, buy signals
  - 🔴 Red: Negative odds, losing bets, sell signals
  - 🟡 Yellow/Amber: Caution, moderate confidence, time-sensitive
  - 🔵 Blue: Neutral information, system status
  - 🟣 Purple: Premium features, high-confidence signals
- **Typography Hierarchy**: Clear distinction between critical data (odds, stakes) and contextual info
- **Spacing & Density**: Balance between information density and readability
- **Micro-interactions**: Smooth animations for state changes, loading, success/error feedback

### 3. Data Visualization
- **Charts & Graphs**: Odds movement trends, P&L curves, confidence distributions
- **Heatmaps**: Strategy performance, time-of-day patterns, team matchups
- **Progress Indicators**: Budget utilization, Kelly Criterion sizing, risk exposure
- **Sparklines**: Compact trend visualization for historical data
- **Status Indicators**: Connection health, signal freshness, model confidence

### 4. Responsive & Adaptive Design
- **Desktop-First for Trading**: Primary interface for serious bettors
- **Mobile-Responsive**: Quick bet placement, alerts, and monitoring on the go
- **Tablet Optimization**: Split-screen dashboards for multi-match tracking
- **Touch-Friendly Controls**: Large tap targets for mobile bet placement

### 5. Accessibility & Usability (WCAG 2.1 AA+)
- **High Contrast Ratios**: Critical text and data easily readable
- **Color-Blind Safe Palettes**: Never rely on color alone for information
- **Keyboard Navigation**: Full functionality without mouse
- **Screen Reader Compatibility**: Semantic HTML, ARIA labels
- **Focus Indicators**: Clear visual feedback for interactive elements
- **Reduced Motion Support**: Respects user preferences for animations

### 6. Performance-Oriented Design
- **Optimized Assets**: SVG icons, compressed images, efficient fonts
- **Skeleton Screens**: Perceived performance during data loading
- **Progressive Enhancement**: Core functionality works even with slow connections
- **Lazy Loading**: Images and non-critical components load on demand

