## Component Design Patterns

### Signal Card (Primary Interaction)
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 🎯 PANIC REBOUND           [92% Confidence] 🟢  │
│ ─────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│ 📊 Back India @ 2.45                            │
│ 💰 Recommended Stake: $150 (Kelly 0.5x)        │
│ ⏱️ Edge Window: 2:34 remaining                  │
│                                                 │
│ Match: IND vs AUS • Over 15.3 • Bangalore      │
│ Reasoning: Sharp momentum reversal after...    │
│                                                 │
│ [Place Bet →]          [More Details ↓]        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Design Decisions:**
- Strategy name prominent (top-left)
- Confidence % with color-coded badge (top-right)
- Critical action (odds, team) in large, bold text
- Kelly sizing pre-calculated (reduces friction)
- Edge window with countdown (creates urgency)
- Primary CTA (Place Bet) vs. Secondary (Details)

### Budget Panel (Financial Overview)
