│ [Allocate to Match] [Reset Budget]             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Design Decisions:**
- Large, clear balance display (most important info)
- P&L with percentage and trend indicator
- Quick actions for budget management
- Visual separation between master and allocated budgets

