## Animation & Transitions

### Timing Functions
- **Ease Out (default)**: `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` (smooth, fast exit)
- **Ease In**: `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1)` (for dismissals)
- **Spring**: `cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)` (playful, for celebrations)

### Durations
- **Instant**: 50ms (checkbox toggles, immediate feedback)
- **Quick**: 150ms (hover states, button presses)
- **Normal**: 250ms (modals, dropdowns, cards)
- **Slow**: 400ms (page transitions, large state changes)
- **Very Slow**: 600ms (celebration animations, success confirmations)

### Key Animations

#### New Signal Arrival
```css
@keyframes slideInBounce {
  0% { transform: translateX(-100px); opacity: 0; }
  60% { transform: translateX(10px); opacity: 1; }
  100% { transform: translateX(0); }
}
/* Duration: 400ms, Easing: spring */
```

#### Winning Bet Celebration
```css
@keyframes successPulse {
  0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.7); }
  50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 20px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); }
}
/* Duration: 600ms, Repeat: 2 times */
```

#### Edge Window Countdown (Urgency)
```css
@keyframes urgentBlink {
  0%, 50%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  25%, 75% { opacity: 0.5; }
}
/* Duration: 1000ms, Repeat: infinite (when < 30s remaining) */
```

#### Loading Skeleton
```css
@keyframes shimmer {
  0% { background-position: -1000px 0; }
  100% { background-position: 1000px 0; }
}
/* Duration: 2000ms, Repeat: infinite */
```

